@startuml
title 图5-6 定制服务模块定制订单创建时序图（C 端）

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as U
participant "微信小程序" as MP
participant "AppCustomController" as CC
participant "IClOrderService" as OS
participant "IClCustomOrderService" as CS
database "MySQL" as DB

U -> MP : 选择材质/尺寸等\n填写定制文字与收货信息
MP -> CC : POST /api/app/custom/create\n(custom JSON + 收货信息)
CC -> OS : 创建订单主记录与明细\n(orderType=1)
OS -> DB : INSERT cl_order, cl_order_item
CC -> CS : 计算排队并生成 queue_no
CS -> DB : SELECT COUNT 排队中定制单
DB --> CS
CS -> DB : INSERT cl_custom_order
DB --> CS
CS --> CC : queueNo, queuePosition, estimatedTime
CC --> MP : AjaxResult(data)
MP --> U : 展示排队卡片

note over CC, DB
  设计约束：订单主数据与
  cl_custom_order 在同一事务提交，
  与「订单模块」创建路径二选一或
  并存时需在实现层避免重复写库。
end note

@enduml
